# Development baseline seed

`DEV_BASELINE_DATE` is fixed reference history for warm-up testing.

- User-data reset must preserve its workout and sets.
- `seedDevBaselineSets` is insert-if-missing and must not wipe existing data.
- App startup and reset may call the seed safely after migrations or user reset.
